<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following production and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for August 26-September 1  and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		 Aug 26-Sept 1		     TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>			 1996	 1995	    1996	   1995</p>
<p> Stocks/open    297,057.1	 n/a</p>
<p> Production	38,232.8	 n/a	 325,813.5	 n/a</p>
<p> Shipment	  20,789.6	 n/a	 178,950.8	 n/a</p>
<p> Home Market	  270.4	 n/a	   2,573.4	 n/a</p>
<p> Stocks/close   314,229.9	 n/a</p>
<p>-- Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151</p>
</text>
